1
00:00:00,245 --> 00:00:03,625
...has gotta be easier to deal with
than him touching her with it.

2
00:00:05,208 --> 00:00:07,838
There's no junk-jiggling. We just talk.

3
00:00:08,462 --> 00:00:11,922
(Howard:)Are you insane? With high-speed
Internet, you have at your fingertips...

4
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:16,590
(Howard:)...the greatest advancement in the field
of sex since the invention of the washcloth.

5
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,680
(Leonard:)I can't do that.

6
00:00:19,848 --> 00:00:22,808
Heh, well, if you don't,
you're gonna lose Priya...

7
00:00:22,976 --> 00:00:24,936
(Howard:)...to some fancy guy in a turban...

8
00:00:25,103 --> 00:00:27,943
(Howard:)...who grew up
with Kama Sutra coloring books.

9
00:00:28,899 --> 00:00:30,189
(Raj:)How can you be so racist?

10
00:00:30,359 --> 00:00:32,319
(Howard:)Oh, come on, tell me I'm wrong.

11
00:00:33,445 --> 00:00:35,655
(Sheldon(entering):)Oh, Leonard, good, there you are.

12
00:00:35,822 --> 00:00:38,612
(Sheldon(entering):)I need you to check my head
for chair lice.

13
00:00:39,868 --> 00:00:42,368
(Leonard:)I did it last night,
I'm not doing it again.

14
00:00:43,413 --> 00:00:45,163
(Howard:)Just his head, right?

15
00:00:46,458 --> 00:00:48,458
I don't wanna talk about it.

16
00:00:49,669 --> 00:00:52,339
(Leonard:)You didn't catch bugs
from Penny's chair.

17
00:00:52,506 --> 00:00:56,096
(Sheldon:)Yes, I did. And now they're cavorting
at the base of my hair follicles...

18
00:00:56,259 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)...like dancing hippies
at the Redwood National Forest.

